{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_72_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，王三月，丁丑，宋公禦說卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會宰周公、齊侯、宋子、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯於葵丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"天子之宰，通於四海。宋其稱子何也？未葬之辭也。禮，柩在堂，孤無外事。今背殯而出會，以宋子為無哀矣。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，乙酉，伯姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"內女也，未適人不卒，此何以卒也？許嫁笄而字之，死則以成人之喪治之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"四、九月，戊辰，諸侯盟於葵丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"桓盟不日，此何以日？美之也。為見天子之禁，故備之也。葵丘之會，陳牲而不殺，讀書加於牲上，壹明天子之禁。曰毋雍泉，毋訖糴，毋易樹子，毋以妾為妻，毋使婦人與國事。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"五、甲子，晉侯詭諸卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉里克殺其君之子奚齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_72_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_72","textTraditional":"其君之子云者，國人不子也。國人不子何也？不正其殺世子申生而立之也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}